# 选鸟目录的本地备份（形如 .superpicky_backup_<卷名>_<时间戳>/，内含 report.db
# 等用户数据，体积大且与代码无关）。用通配符覆盖全部时间戳变体，避免
# `git add -A` 误把备份数据提交进仓库。
# Local backups of culling directories (.superpicky_backup_<volume>_<timestamp>/).
# They hold user data such as report.db — large and unrelated to the code. The
# wildcard covers every timestamped variant so `git add -A` cannot commit them.
.superpicky_backup_*/

